stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Queued: job submitted to Kueue
  Queued --> Running: gang of N GPUs admitted
  Running --> Checkpointing: every N steps
  Checkpointing --> Running
  Running --> Preempted: serving scale-up or Spot reclaim
  Preempted --> Queued: auto requeue with same run ID
  Queued --> Resuming: capacity returns
  Resuming --> Running: load latest checkpoint
  Running --> EvalGate: training complete
  EvalGate --> Registry: scores pass thresholds
  EvalGate --> Failed: scores regress - alert
  Registry --> [*]: promoted to serving via canary
  Failed --> [*]
